WEBVTT

00:00:00.000 --> 00:00:17.450
Let's upload your USTA data into TenAceIQ to keep results, player links, schedules, and team insights accurate, connected, and ready.

00:00:17.650 --> 00:00:24.710
Open TennisLink and tap Sign In. Enter your information privately.

00:00:24.910 --> 00:00:32.280
Open Stats and Standings and search for your team.

00:00:32.480 --> 00:00:39.850
Tap the blue team name to open the team page.

00:00:40.050 --> 00:00:45.640
On Team Summary, tap Send to Excel.

00:00:45.840 --> 00:00:54.000
When your phone asks for confirmation, tap Download. The file saves to Downloads.

00:00:54.200 --> 00:00:59.960
Choose Player Roster and download that report the same way.

00:01:00.160 --> 00:01:05.710
Open Match Summary and choose the Match ID you want.

00:01:05.910 --> 00:01:13.660
Choose View Score, then download the scorecard.

00:01:13.860 --> 00:01:20.010
Open TenAceIQ and tap the upload icon in the top-right corner.

00:01:20.210 --> 00:01:27.630
Choose Scorecard for match results, scores, and winners.

00:01:27.830 --> 00:01:35.700
Choose Player Roster for players, ratings, and team links.

00:01:35.900 --> 00:01:41.420
Choose Schedule for dates, opponents, courts, and sites.

00:01:41.620 --> 00:01:51.050
In Downloads, tap the Excel file matching the source you chose.

00:01:51.250 --> 00:01:59.920
Wait for the Review Ready message while TenAceIQ prepares the review.

00:02:00.120 --> 00:02:05.830
Review the match, players, winners, and scores.

00:02:06.030 --> 00:02:11.410
If everything is correct, tap Looks right - import.

00:02:11.610 --> 00:02:25.100
Import complete. Repeat these steps for any other USTA files you downloaded.

00:02:25.300 --> 00:02:40.850
Thank you for strengthening our site's data and accuracy. Members like you make our data, tools, and community better.
